        <li><strong>For Documents:</strong> Advanced Natural Language Processing (NLP) techniques parse and segment complex documents – from lengthy legal contracts and multi-thousand-page M&A data rooms to dense financial reports (10-Ks, prospectuses) and technical specifications in the energy sector. This allows PSQRD to isolate distinct, verifiable assertions, obligations, dates, figures, and key entities.</li>
