      <h3>Granular Risk Stratification & Editorial/Professional Prioritization</h3>
      <p><strong>The Challenge:</strong> Not all extracted information carries the same weight or requires the same level of immediate scrutiny, especially during breaking news or high-pressure due diligence.</p>
      
      <p><strong>PSQRD's Approach:</strong> Extracted claims undergo a sophisticated risk stratification process. This framework, customizable by the enterprise, assesses claims based on potential impact, controversiality, source ambiguity, or specific criteria relevant to the task (e.g., materiality thresholds in finance, specific regulatory keywords in compliance, indemnification clauses in M&A). This ensures that AI-driven rigor aligns directly with your editorial priorities, legal strategy, or financial risk tolerance, focusing resources where they matter most.</p>
      
      <h3>Context-Aware Search & Advanced, Curated Sourcing</h3>
      <p><strong>The Challenge:</strong> Generic search engines often surface irrelevant, outdated, or low-quality information, wasting valuable time. Professionals need targeted access to authoritative sources.</p>
      
