      </ul>
      
      <h2>Conclusion: From Opaque Guesswork to Illuminated Proof</h2>
      <p>PSQRD's architecture is a testament to our belief that AI, to be truly transformative for enterprises, must be built on a foundation of demonstrable truth. By deconstructing the "black box" and offering a transparent, step-by-step validation process, PSQRD provides not just answers, but answers you can trust, audit, and confidently act upon. This is the future of enterprise AI – a future where intelligence is not just artificial, but verifiably authentic.</p>
      
